NEW UPDATE FOR BREACH 2D LOG 07/11/2026
------------------------------------------------------------
You can now customize how much squadmates you can have
------------------------------------------------------------
Where: Deploy screen, under Squad. The “Squad size” row cycles from 0 (solo) to 4.
Classes: Each squadmate has its own class (Assault, Medic or Marksman). Your choices are saved.
Formation: A bigger squad spreads out behind you in a staggered formation, and the squad commands work for everyone.
